  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal, by reason of the site being located within an area of land liable to\r\nflooding and the lack of a comprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, due to a lack\r\nof up to date flood maps/data, has failed to demonstrate that the proposed\r\ndevelopment would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or\r\nincrease the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI12 and SI13 of The London\r\nPlan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies DM9\r\nand DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
